                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Transformable objects need to be part of a glTF 2.0 Display component.

The name of the component is also important, as there might be several such components in the definition! The Gumball Input uses a dot-separated name for filtering objects: DISPLAY_COMPONENT_NAME.OBJECT_NAME</item>
